//~ CHECK-ONLY
// opt: the release passes of stage1 (contracts/opt-passes.md) over the checked IR of `ir`.
//
// Modules:
//   facts    the decision's facts F1-F9: site rows, sizes, slots, `ret`, the call graph with its
//            components and levels, the callee tests E and the caller tests L
//   decide   the decision D1-D7: closed sizes and slots, verdicts, the `inline` dump, the limits
//   expand   the expansion X1-X7 under the stored decision: counted, then written per fn
//   clean    the clean-up C*: rounds of C1-C6 per body until a round changes nothing
